2026-11-01T06:43:57.5392181Z CAUGHT             C32 a home-screen tile opens on a phone that is not the owner's
2026-11-01T06:43:57.5392951Z CAUGHT             C32 an external link carries a second scheme into the page
2026-11-01T06:43:57.5393576Z CAUGHT             C32 an ephemeral copy never expires
